[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588350543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101513#issuecomment-2588350543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101513","id":2588350543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aRxhP","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T22:25:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T22:38:17Z","body":"Reverting the changes I have made to fix another bug is not a good fix.\r\n\r\nwe can change\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\t\t\tRef<AtlasTexture> atlas = picker_texture_zoom->get_texture();\r\n\t\t\tif (atlas.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tatlas->set_region(Rect2i(ofs.x - 8, ofs.y - 8, 17, 17));\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nto \r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\t\t\tif (picker_texture_zoom.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tRef<AtlasTexture> atlas = picker_texture_zoom->get_texture();\r\n\t\t\t\tif (atlas.is_valid()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tatlas->set_region(Rect2i(ofs.x - 8, ofs.y - 8, 17, 17));\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588350543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2588357143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101513#issuecomment-2588357143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101513","id":2588357143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aRzIX","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T22:28:52Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T22:28:52Z","body":"I confirm this fixes the issue for me with X11/XWayland, multi-window on Fedora 41 KDE Wayland.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4719dc5-6212-4e4c-998e-3a041503dd50)\r\n\r\nThere's still room for improvement possibly (weird resizing of the window with black bars on top and bottom, and the preview is either a black or white square with just a tiny preview of the actual color), but these predate #101266. It looks the 